==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==Battleground==
*5 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cumulus Gallus]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Zamelle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Shigong Cat]] with Research [[Cat Combo]]s as your main meatshield, and make sure to lure the enemies to your base to prevent clogging the cat limit of 15. Long distance attackers can help damage Cumulus Gallus and anti-Zombie midrangers/backliners (such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Minka]]) will help defeat the Formicidaean Ariant and Zir Zeals. This stage becomes quite easy when the Cumulus Gallus is defeated.

